<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - St. Paul Cos cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - St. Paul Cos cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it downgraded St. Paul Cos Inc to intermediate-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- said kept St. Paul Cos as long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- On Monday, St. Paul posted second quarter operating earnings of $1.31 a share compared with $1.14 a share a year ago.</p>
<p>-- St. Paul Cos lost 1-2/16 to 80-11/16.</p>
</text>
